{"type":"text","timestamp":1790403330855,"sessionID":"ses_f23aa6c0fffeP5jJPzPzKBrgRi","part":{"id":"prt_0dc5ac3120011C7y1d1aoVHkX5","messageID":"msg_0dc5a6972001JgvY4iKPrXVCqX","sessionID":"ses_f23aa6c0fffeP5jJPzPzKBrgRi","type":"text","text":"The collision math aligns with the existing body layers: player bodies use layer 1, enemies layer 2, while detection areas use layers 4/8 and mask only the opposing body layer. I’ll add the two reusable scripts, configure a 32-pixel base radius in the scene, and propagate each duplicated `UnitStats` resource into its detection area.","time":{"start":1790403330834,"end":1790403330836},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_091f5229f2fb83d5016ab763023de881959808598604a83935","phase":"commentary"}}}}
